{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは、\n新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだはBirthDay LIVEでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さったみなさん\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"７時間半の中で\n楽曲ごとに思い出も振り返る事が出来て\nなんだか感動しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて参加した思い出の楽曲。\n歌割があってポジションがあって\nそれだけで幸せだった。\n衣装の早替え成功して良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォーメーションダンスのおかげで\nいつも凝った演出をつけて下さるのが\n凄く嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手先、足先が揃って納得いくまで何回も\n練習してました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブと一緒に成長した曲。\nイントロを聴くと不思議と世界観に\nのめり込めるんだよね。\nダンスも大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由の彼方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちよく歌える音域の曲！\n乃木坂のライブでやるのは\n初めてでしたかどうでしたかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ!Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"市來さんポジションでした！\n自転車で登場という斬新な演出で\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\n自転車似合わないだの\n乗り方が変だの\n散々いじられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やさしさなら間に合ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも市來さんポジション。\nユニットに参加した事なかったから\n少ない人数で歌うの緊張しました\nでも楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この他にもたくさんの楽曲に\n参加させて頂けて\n幸せでした*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日はたくさんの\nサプライズ発表もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・日本記念日協会が２月２２日を\n「乃木坂４６の日」と認定"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・アンダーライブ３rdシーズン開催決定\n４月１４〜１９日＠六本木ブルーシアター！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・新プロジェクトメンバー募集"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・「１６人のプリンシパル公演」\n秋に延期（代わりに）新舞台決定！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木坂カフェ＠原宿の\nカフェマネージャー就任"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何より\n研究生の全員昇格！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におめでとう。\n発表された瞬間\nこれまでのことを思い出しました。\nいろいろあったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この先もきっといろんなことがあるけど\n一緒に頑張ろうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも頼りないわたしですが\nこれからもよろしく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、、、\n乃木坂４６、\n３歳のお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６に関わる全ての方\nありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６に入って良かった。\nこれからもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６カフェ＠原宿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？カフェ以来\n２回目のカフェマネージャーを任せて\n頂くことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日からちょくちょくブログやモバメで\n匂わせていた＜ある事＞とは\nこのカフェのこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は前回のカフェとは\n全く異なるカフェになると思うので、\nいい意味で期待を裏切りたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間　2015年3月27日（金）〜5月10日（日）\n10:00〜11:30 / 12:30〜14:00 / 15:15〜16:45 / 17:45〜19:15 / 20:30〜22:00"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の完全入れ替え制"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/25/6901924/0010.gif","alt":""},